CORE
test.c
--nondet-volatile-write-model data:observe_data --nondet-volatile-write-model cmd:observe_cmd
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
data committed before GO: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
Without --mmio the write models are called in program order (strongly ordered),
so the ordering assertion holds. --mmio (see test.desc) applies the weakest
sound model and exposes the missing-barrier bug with no extra flags.
